    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MUST";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Service declaration must meet facility size and importance criteria.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(c) that the facility is of national significance, having regard to:  (i) the size of the facility; or  (ii) the importance of the facility to constitutional trade or commerce; or  (iii) the importance of the facility to the national economy;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(c) that the facility is of national significance, having regard to:  (i) the size of the facility; or  (ii) the importance of the facility to constitutional trade or commerce; or  (iii) the importance of the facility to the national economy;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
