    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Service declaration must promote public interest.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(d) that access (or increased access) to the service, on reasonable terms and conditions, as a result of a declaration of the service would promote the public interest.";
