    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Service declaration must meet market demand criteria.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) that the facility that is used (or will be used) to provide the service could meet the total foreseeable demand in the market:  (i) over the period for which the service would be declared; and  (ii) at the least cost compared to any 2 or more facilities (which could include the first-mentioned facility);";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(b) that the facility that is used (or will be used) to provide the service could meet the total foreseeable demand in the market:  (i) over the period for which the service would be declared; and  (ii) at the least cost compared to any 2 or more facilities (which could include the first-mentioned facility);";
