    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) For the purposes of this section, an acquisition may have the effect or be likely to have the effect of substantially lessening competition in a market if the acquisition would, in all the circumstances, have the effect, or be likely to have the effect, of creating, strengthening or entrenching a substantial degree of power in the market.";
